│ {"study_index": 78, "title": "Estimation of the sexual transmission of HIV in Kenya and Uganda on the trans‐Africa   │
│ highway: the continuing role for prevention in high risk groups", "abstract": "Objective: To explore the effect of   │
│ transactional sex on the trans-Africa highway from Mombasa-Kampala in contributing to the HIV epidemic and the       │
